676
00:40:02,442 --> 00:40:05,236
<i>Keluargaku amat miskin dan sengsara.</i>

677
00:40:05,737 --> 00:40:09,198
<i>Yang kumiliki hanyalah </i>bipa <i>tua.</i>

678
00:40:09,282 --> 00:40:12,952
